callers (off by default): a number nobody in the contacts has is looked up in\nthe Swiss directory of search.ch, with your own free key for private use pasted in the\nsettings; only that number leaves the phone. Data: Swisscom Directories AG.\n\nSix languages. No account; the network is used only to fetch the model and, when you ask\nfor it, the directory.\n"}}, "versions": {"b8760515733d53927da7c61f881b865ffd39911ec7bb95822b73aff5577dca4e": null, "d068f8585417b94923a0c3dcfc3343afcd031caa6a8620eedb9c5aa7efe00622": {"added": 1793024891000, "file": {"name": "/ReadersPhone-v1.6.0.apk", "sha256": "d068f8585417b94923a0c3dcfc3343afcd031caa6a8620eedb9c5aa7efe00622", "size": 36230845}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "x86_64"], "versionName": "1.6.0", "versionCode": 11, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 34}, "signer": {"sha256": ["b9c722e093f963ab7812922623e1c1a72fb9998537ad7d9aefa8b1a3f3a8120c"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.VIBRATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.CALL_PHONE"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_CONTACTS"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_CALL_LOG"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.USE_FULL_SCREEN_INTENT"}, {"name": "android.permission.WAKE_LOCK"}, {"name": "android.permission.SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_PHONE_CALL"}, {"name": "android.permission.MANAGE_OWN_CALLS"}, {"name": "android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MICROPHONE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC"}, {"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "com.freedomfighter.readersphone.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}}}, "com.freedomfighter.readerspodcasts": {"metadata": {"lastUpdated": 1792659529000}, "versions": {"af9f56ed5f5aceca033b107c8010b1306cf71d0bf2bf993ec435e0bd890da1ea