 screen with the caller's photo and name in large type\nand two big buttons; missed calls stay at the top until answered with \"call back\" or \"OK\".\nContacts read favourites, then the people called lately, then everyone, with a search\nfield; a keypad with large keys; the list of calls. When another app is opened during a\ncall, a wide green band stays at the top of the screen with the name and the time on the\nline, and a touch brings the call back. Twelve themes. Unknown callers can be looked up\nin the Swiss directory of search.ch with your own free key (off by default; only that\nnumber leaves the phone; data: Swisscom Directories AG). No account, nothing else goes out.\n"}}, "versions": {"aa22d07b9c1c28988363e9073635c3ccc54eaec3563c1f74a2d6fc4ecf02da07": null, "e8e25afb2e9568c2f07f9e011186c7ea65bd826f47979a34917792c4870da61a": {"added": 1793024891000, "file": {"name": "/TchitchiPhone-v1.4.0.apk", "sha256": "e8e25afb2e9568c2f07f9e011186c7ea65bd826f47979a34917792c4870da61a", "size": 6136898}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "1.4.0", "versionCode": 9, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 34}, "signer": {"sha256": ["b9c722e093f963ab7812922623e1c1a72fb9998537ad7d9aefa8b1a3f3a8120c"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.VIBRATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.CALL_PHONE"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_CONTACTS"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_CALL_LOG"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.USE_FULL_SCREEN_INTENT"}, {"name": "android.permission.WAKE_LOCK"}, {"name": "android.permission.SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_PHONE_CALL"}, {"name": "android.permission.MANAGE_OWN_CALLS"}, {"name": "com.freedomfighter.tchitchi.phone.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}}}}}